{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"goblin_archer","model_identifier":"goblin_archer","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# goblin_archer\n\nGoblin archer (C4), 1.2 m = 43 u (hunched ~40 u).\n\nA wiry 1.2 m goblin, green-grey skin, hunched back and knobbly hump, an oversized head with huge swept ears, a hooked nose, a wide toothy mouth and glowing yellow eyes, long arms (hands at the knee), leather scraps. A short crooked bow of kinked wood, a back quiver of mismatched arrows (different lengths, red/white/black/green fletchings). Shared goblin rig: baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (slot_hand_r, slot_hand_l, slot_head on the scalp, slot_back between the shoulder blades).\n\n- Cubes: 40 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..44.0, z -7.5..7.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 42 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 2 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 0.7 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.42 | loop |  |\n| `flee` | 0.38 | loop | arms flung up, looking back over its shoulder, panicked run (loop) |\n| `taunt` | 1.6 | once | hops side to side, waggles its head and slaps its backside (1.6 s) |\n| `aggro` | 1 | once | hop and lunge (1.0 s) |\n| `injured` | 0.45 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 1.2 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `bow_shoot` | 1.6 | once | draws from the quiver 0.25, nocks 0.6, full draw 0.9; key 1.1 s: release, spawn the arrow at fx_arrow (hand arrow hides) |\n| `attack_stab` | 0.8 | once | key 0.35 s: overhand stab with an arrow in its fist (reach ~16 u) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 46.2 u/s (1.30 m/s), cycle 0.7 s, 32.4 u per cycle\n- `run`: 149.3 u/s (4.20 m/s), cycle 0.42 s, 62.7 u per cycle\n- `flee`: 164.3 u/s (4.62 m/s), cycle 0.38 s, 62.4 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `bow_shoot`: draws from the quiver 0.25, nocks 0.6, full draw 0.9; key 1.1 s: release, spawn the arrow at fx_arrow (hand arrow hides)\n- `attack_stab`: key 0.35 s: overhand stab with an arrow in its fist (reach ~16 u)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 44, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 31, 6)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 31, 5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 27, -5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 18.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 21, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 21, 2.5)\n- `fx_arrow` on `arrow` at (7, 11, -15)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `bow` (visible, under slot_hand_l): 23 u crooked bow, arrow direction along -Z, string at +Z\n- `arrow` (under slot_hand_r): 19 u arrow along -Z; scale keys show it only in bow_shoot (0.25-1.1) and attack_stab\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit cubes.\n- `fx_arrow`: arrow head (projectile spawn).\n- Variant texture: goblin_archer_pale.png.\n"},"description":"# goblin_archer\n\nGoblin archer (C4), 1.2 m = 43 u (hunched ~40 u).\n\nA wiry 1.2 m goblin, green-grey skin, hunched back and knobbly hump, an oversized head with huge swept ears, a hooked nose, a wide toothy mouth and glowing yellow eyes, long arms (hands at the knee), leather scraps. A short crooked bow of kinked wood, a back quiver of mismatched arrows (different lengths, red/white/black/green fletchings). Shared goblin rig: baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (slot_hand_r, slot_hand_l, slot_head on the scalp, slot_back between the shoulder blades).\n\n- Cubes: 40 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..44.0, z -7.5..7.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 42 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 2 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 0.7 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.42 | loop |  |\n| `flee` | 0.38 | loop | arms flung up, looking back over its shoulder, panicked run (loop) |\n| `taunt` | 1.6 | once | hops side to side, waggles its head and slaps its backside (1.6 s) |\n| `aggro` | 1 | once | hop and lunge (1.0 s) |\n| `injured` | 0.45 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 1.2 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `bow_shoot` | 1.6 | once | draws from the quiver 0.25, nocks 0.6, full draw 0.9; key 1.1 s: release, spawn the arrow at fx_arrow (hand arrow hides) |\n| `attack_stab` | 0.8 | once | key 0.35 s: overhand stab with an arrow in its fist (reach ~16 u) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 46.2 u/s (1.30 m/s), cycle 0.7 s, 32.4 u per cycle\n- `run`: 149.3 u/s (4.20 m/s), cycle 0.42 s, 62.7 u per cycle\n- `flee`: 164.3 u/s (4.62 m/s), cycle 0.38 s, 62.4 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `bow_shoot`: draws from the quiver 0.25, nocks 0.6, full draw 0.9; key 1.1 s: release, spawn the arrow at fx_arrow (hand arrow hides)\n- `attack_stab`: key 0.35 s: overhand stab with an arrow in its fist (reach ~16 u)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 44, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 31, 6)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 31, 5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 27, -5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 18.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 21, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 21, 2.5)\n- `fx_arrow` on `arrow` at (7, 11, -15)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `bow` (visible, under slot_hand_l): 23 u crooked bow, arrow direction along -Z, string at +Z\n- `arrow` (under slot_hand_r): 19 u arrow along -Z; scale keys show it only in bow_shoot (0.25-1.1) and attack_stab\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit cubes.\n- `fx_arrow`: arrow head (projectile spawn).\n- Variant texture: goblin_archer_pale.png.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.5,18.0,-3.0],"to":[4.5,22.0,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,18.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[88,31,97.0,35.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,38,6.0,42.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[97,31,106.0,35.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[6,38,12.0,42.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[66,31,75.0,37.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[75,31,84.0,37.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"4f387cde-385c-5faf-b469-17facdb0ca2f"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.5,22.0,-3.5],"to":[5.5,34.0,3.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,22.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[20,0,31.0,12.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[42,0,49.0,12.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[31,0,42.0,12.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[49,0,56.0,12.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[70,22,81.0,29.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[81,22,92.0,29.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"fdaabc6a-6e0f-50a9-86cc-724acb6a9e74"},{"name":"neck","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.5,34.0,-1.5],"to":[1.5,35.0,1.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,34.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[46,47,49.0,48.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[49,47,52.0,48.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[52,47,55.0,48.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[55,47,58.0,48.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[4,42,7.0,45.0],"texture":0},"down